# Full test suite

From `build/Release`, before any commit and after a feature is finished:

```bash
ctest --output-on-failure
```

Re-run `cmake` in that directory when tests were added or the tree was reconfigured. All tests must pass. A green `qumode-*` subset is not enough when the change touches `QasmParser.y`, `QasmScanner.l`, or a shared AST builder.

After editing `lib/Parser/QasmParser.y`, regenerate the parser by hand and rebuild `QasmParser`. The CMake bison rule does not depend on the `.y` file.
